Lower Ampere HMMA.1688/.16816.F16 to one HMMA_NATIVE pseudo-instruction whose
translator builds the IR directly, adapted from heydemoura/EglantinePS5@35b485d
(patch 0013). Hooked into our existing case 0x23c after the same register and mode
checks; opcode 0x5D38 (0101 1101 0011 1---) was free in this tree. Default on;
EDEN_NX2_HMMA_NATIVE=0 keeps the software Maxwell expansion. Cooperative matrix
and diagnostic patch 0014 are left out. Upstream Bananza IR/shuffle shrinks were
measured on another PS5, not on this build.
